    {
      "id": "94a79e95-af7a-43d3-8b97-1b713b8ecbee",
      "title": "MNI Deduplication (Senzing):",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "cd630c35-aea7-492c-8a91-5bb285a0f76f",
          "title": "",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "fe854c43-0f72-488e-a187-4103652607f8",
              "content": "<p>Completed approximately 95% of the MNI dedupe work, successfully processing roughly 430K MNIs. There are approximately 24K MNIs that have not yet been merged in the UI.</p>"
            },
            {
              "id": "305296a9-b161-4611-a286-e30e46defbfb",
              "content": "<p>At a high level, the remaining records appear to fall into a couple of scenarios:</p><ul><li>Some MNIs were already merged into a different primary GUID than the one identified in the Senzing output</li><li>Some of the primary or duplicate GUIDs are associated with reports that are still In Progress or in Records Review, which may prevent the merge from completing.</li></ul>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
